OL,3,GNEWSACouncil approves library
OL,4,Acost-cutting plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCuts to library services aimed at
OL,7,Freducing the budget by #300,000 a year
OL,8,Fhave been approved.
OL,10,FConservative-led Northumberland County
OL,11,FCouncil's cabinet boasted there would
OL,12,Fbe no compulsory job losses under the
OL,13,Fplan, which also sees more face-to-face
OL,14,Fservices in rural areas, however hours
OL,15,Fwill be cut and staff numbers reduced
OL,16,Fthrough voluntary redundancies.
OL,18,FA consultation saw 6,000 residents have
OL,19,Ftheir say before the cabinet approved
OL,20,Fplans which included some libraries
OL,21,Fbeing staffed for 12 hours per week and
OL,22,Fothers being run by volunteers.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
